     "t": "math",
     "tex": "\\lim_{s \\to -\\infty} \\frac{e^s}{(s+1)(s+2)} = \\frac{e^{-\\infty}}{(-\\infty)(-\\infty)} = \\frac{0}{\\infty} = 0 \\implies \\text{NOT a pole at } -\\infty"
