       "t": "math",
       "tex": "P = \\frac{1}{N_0} \\sum_{n=\\langle N_0 \\rangle} \\vert x[n]\\vert^2 = \\sum_{k=\\langle N_0 \\rangle} \\vert c_k\\vert^2"
