     "t": "p",
     "text": "Convergence for term 1 requires $\\vert z \\vert > \\vert a e^{j\\omega_0} \\vert = \\vert a \\vert$, and term 2 requires $\\vert z \\vert > \\vert a e^{-j\\omega_0} \\vert = \\vert a \\vert$. Thus, the common ROC is $\\vert z \\vert > \\vert a \\vert$."
