     "t": "math",
     "tex": "D(z) = (z - a e^{j\\omega_0})(z - a e^{-j\\omega_0}) = z^2 - a z \\left( e^{j\\omega_0} + e^{-j\\omega_0} \\right) + a^2 = z^2 - 2 a z \\cos\\omega_0 + a^2"
