     "tex": "N(z) = \\frac{1}{2} \\left[ z(z - a e^{-j\\omega_0}) + z(z - a e^{j\\omega_0}) \\right] = \\frac{1}{2} \\left[ 2 z^2 - a z (e^{j\\omega_0} + e^{-j\\omega_0}) \\right] = z^2 - a z \\cos\\omega_0"
